      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh my! We meet again!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRemember me? I’m the perfumer who creates\nfragrances using materials from Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You found me at a good time. I’ve had another\nidea for a new perfume!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200066006F0075006E00640020006D00650020006100740020006100200067006F006F0064002000740069006D0065002E00200049201900760065002000680061006400200061006E006F0074006800650072000A006900640065006100200066006F0072002000610020006E00650077002000700065007200660075006D0065002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This time, I’d like to try using fresh snow that\nVanillite produce with their breath.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vanillite are so white and fluffy, just like ice cream\ncones. I’m awfully curious to find out what sort of<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nscent they have...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So if you could bring me a Vanillite, I’d be very\ngrateful. Please and thank you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you manage to catch a Vanillite, please put it in\nyour party and bring it here!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you’ve brought a Vanillite! Thanks so much!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200079006F0075201900760065002000620072006F007500670068007400200061002000560061006E0069006C006C00690074006500210020005400680061006E006B007300200073006F0020006D007500630068002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll go ahead and take a pinch of snow, then.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200067006F00200061006800650061006400200061006E0064002000740061006B006500200061002000700069006E006300680020006F006600200073006E006F0077002C0020007400680065006E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gosh, that’s cold!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell, Vanillite do exhale air at minus 58 degrees\nFahrenheit, so that makes sense.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regular snow doesn’t have its own scent, but I\nfeel like Pokémon snow might just surprise us.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLet’s find out, shall we?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Vanillite perfume is all finished!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0079002000560061006E0069006C006C006900740065002000700065007200660075006D006500200069007300200061006C006C002000660069006E00690073006800650064002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It turns out that Vanillite’s snow has a softly\nsweet aroma. Who’d have thought?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just a sniff of this aroma is enough to send a cool\nfeeling through you. It’s really quite mysterious!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! I just realized...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000490020006A0075007300740020007200650061006C0069007A00650064002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This could be a huge hit in tropical areas like the\nAlola region! I’m seeing all sorts of possibilities!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon perfumes have such potential, don’t\nthey? Let’s work on them together again soon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
